Bound every wait on the W5500 (socket command, send complete, transmit space) to 20 ms:
a chip that stops answering then drops a frame, which TCP resends, instead of hanging the device.

diff --git a/src/qnethernet/drivers/driver_w5500.cpp b/src/qnethernet/drivers/driver_w5500.cpp
